# Diluc Furina Lynette Xianyun. ~24s Rot. Diluc Vape plunge. Lynette feeds mass Anemo particles to Xianyun then bursts after Xianyun, absorbing Hydro. Xianyun can use TTDS if Lynette bursts prior. Skill uses bookend Diluc's field time, needed for energy. 50% Collisions. 

# Team - Options Listed by DPS
diluc char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
diluc add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
#diluc add weapon="rainslasher" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
diluc add set="longnightsoath" count=4;
#diluc add set="cw" count=4;
#diluc add set="mh" count=4;
diluc add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 pyro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
diluc add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.1102 em=79.28 cr=0.3972 cd=0.662; # SS + Other
